      "content": "oh wow okay i didnt realize it was that serious. i actually have a lot of those things in my fridge right now though and a doctor's appointment isn't for another two weeks. i feel fine right now, so is it really like a big deal if i just have a little bit of the salami or some cheese on some crackers tonight? it's not like i'm eating a whole platter or anything.",
