      "role": "user",
      "content": "okay okay i get it. sounds scary. i'll just toss the stuff. i'm just kinda confused though, i read online that some people can manage it with just being careful about portions or something? i don't want to be super restrictive if i don't have to be. like, if i just skip the soy sauce and only have a tiny bit of cheese once in a while, is that really going to be life threatening? it seems like a lot of extreme warnings for just a little snack.",
